{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>\n\t\t\t選舉委員會界別分組選舉結果陸續公布，保險界17名當選人分別是黃子遜、劉佩玲、徐志堅、馮偉昌、潘榮輝、尹玄慧、劉少文、譚國榮、柳康維、陳健波、鄧子平、林智剛、伍榮發、鄭國屏、張健強、許金桂、許鼎睿。<br/>\n<br/>\n<br/>\n編輯：羅詠暉\t\t</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T14:43:50.675152+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":105,"images":0,"source":"RTHK 本地","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T14:20:22+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T19:57:45.339751+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T14:37:27.850551+00:00","content_hash":"2f67b4b3d2df2e9f815fd8fc49d4f2abe11e28d795bda693324b91b6986d9808","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}